dership remains in deadlock. The government has set up roadblocks to keep protesters at bay.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic report: Is Russia using AI for disinformation in the Central African Republic and elsewhere?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:92ca3bf950d6e73805c1ed36b4c7ea673518257507f6b529764cec74975755a3</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:43:57Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T17:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-report-is-russia-using-ai-for-disinformation-in-the-central-african-republic-and-elsewhere/a-79476947--5ab896d891c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-report-is-russia-using-ai-for-disinformation-in-the-central-african-republic-and-elsewhere/a-79476947?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An Anthropic report says the AI model Claude was used in pro-Russian campaigns in the Central African Republic. Similar allegations were raised for the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Kenya, Sudan and Mali.</summary><category term="Technology" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's Merz visits Kyiv as Russia strikes bridge</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:857160145acf05db1a8fd12598b3a6e2c8b130507900ea61aaa9622566af672c</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T14:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-merz-visits-kyiv-as-russia-strikes-bridge/a-79534734--9ac3ff548705.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-merz-visits-kyiv-as-russia-strikes-bridge/a-79534734?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As air raid sirens sounded in Kyiv, Chancellor Merz called on President Putin to end his "senseless war" and announced new measures to support Ukraine, including plans for joint Ukrainian-German drone production.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump names AI czar to head White House task force</title