y is the last day of Oktoberfest in Munich. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>In Tigray, Ethiopian government forces have advanced against a northern rebel group, reports indicate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6ac05c7accab06d3dbaf21f41a262641036dfc705be7a3752398a3ca4f8613e7</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T03:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/in-tigray-ethiopian-government-forces-have-advanced-against-a-northern-rebel-group-reports-indicate/a-79534372--ed90e271ae47.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/in-tigray-ethiopian-government-forces-have-advanced-against-a-northern-rebel-group-reports-indicate/a-79534372?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Reports indicate Ethiopian government forces have made advances against a northern rebel group. Renewed fighting has raised fears the conflict could spill over into the wider region.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Peru: Fire burning on road to Machu Picchu kills 1</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f20fc924163ab3633d4fa5b3caf5fe792f3c5940b9b9eaab7cb096a95427494</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T02:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/peru-fire-burning-on-road-to-machu-picchu-kills-1/a-79534344--e801992ff38b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/peru-fire-burning-on-road-to-machu-picchu-kills-1/a-79534344?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One person has died and two others have suffered burns in a fire near the main access route to the historic sanctuary of Machu Picchu.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>AI giants 'not being nearly careful enough,' warns outgoing OpenAI safety engineer</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:df2861d954fc0ddd98c4839dc79ce162e2dc4fc8fa58da4659a1d0144fac5a19</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42