n-chief-resigns-after-botched-execution-of-murderer-christa-pike/a-79532481?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prison commissioner Frank Strada insisted his team followed protocol, even after two doses of anesthetic failed to kill convicted murderer Christa Pike. He is set to leave his post this month.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine to step up oil attacks as Russia hits Kyiv bridges</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:912e738e1c2e009ad8bbb90c1248ebaa6cb7ab823144cce217b86316a2d6b7ac</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T17:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-to-step-up-oil-attacks-as-russia-hits-kyiv-bridges/a-79527753--849b2892c79a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-to-step-up-oil-attacks-as-russia-hits-kyiv-bridges/a-79527753?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Moscow intensifies attacks on Kyiv and other cities, Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy has vowed to hit Russian energy infrastructure.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>UK remands 2 Iranians over alleged antisemitic terror plot</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2303205dfba7660eb5ace8a5a2bee9a4f44d55ade9e6cc05e4cfe3c55136d76</id><updated>2026-10-04T19:42:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T16:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184--b38b3689556f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-remands-2-iranians-over-alleged-antisemitic-terror-plot/a-79532184?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The pair were arrested on the eve of Yom Kippur and later charged with plotting to attack Jewish targets in Manchester.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Massive protests after housing bills voted down</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fc86c0a4713a