southeast/a-79529983?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities in Spain rescued some 90 people after heavy rain sparked flooding in the town of Madrigueras. Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez expressed his condolences to the family of a 102-year-old woman who died.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
